// embers — the first kernel: a rill mounted on a spray.
//
// Every line is an independent flow over the row. `spawn` launches a
// newborn along the spray's aim at the spray's speed; `gravity` bends every
// row's velocity by the spray's own knob, a broadcast — write
// plane.drift.@<name>.gravity from any rill and every row feels it next
// tick; `perish` retires a row when its age reaches its life. Integration
// is not a word: a velocity moves its position.
spawn
gravity plane.drift.@self.gravity
perish
